# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps 1–3 introduce the QRMI API by using simple circuits. Each step maps to a core phase of the QRMI lifecycle against IBM Quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr "Pașii 1–3 introduc API-ul QRMI folosind circuite simple. Fiecare pas corespunde unei faze de bază a ciclului de viață QRMI pe hardware IBM Quantum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
